      "title": "Mouse scroll event read and wheel accumulator updated inside deferred closure",
      "message": "The scroll handler reads `s.Delta.Y` and mutates `v.wheel` inside a closure passed to `Owner.Do`. If `Do` runs later or on another goroutine, the event object may have been recycled by then. The accumulator is also touched from a different context than in `VirtualTable`, where it is updated directly in the event handler. This inconsistency risks races or a stale delta.",
